<#ff96dc>SOS BRIGADE SUMMONS  (RNG)</>
Random Assist		^C
  500 meter. Random member: Nagato, Mikuru (600 meter) or
  Konata.
  Each is a 1 in 3 chance. Only one assist on screen at a
  time.
Nagato Extender (in a combo)		^C
  Cancel a normal or special that hit: Nagato always comes
  and launches.
  Once per combo. Calling her again in the same combo whiffs
  and drops it.
Summon Roulette		_D_B_D_B^C
  1 bar: Shana always.
  2+ bars: Shana 6 / Misaka 4. Misaka costs 2 bars.
  3+ bars at half life or lower: Shana 50% / Misaka 30% /
  Goku 20%.
  Goku costs 3 bars.
Desperation Goku		_D_B_D_B^C
  Hold C right after the input, at a quarter life with 5
  bars:
  Goku is guaranteed, uses all 5 bars and goes Super Saiyan
  Blue.
Goku Kamehameha (early)		_D_B_D_B^C
  Input again while he charges. At full charge (18 seconds)
  he fires an unblockable one on his own.
  Misaka's Railgun charges without a super pause; if she is
  hit she runs off.

<#ff96dc>SYSTEM</>
Shield (Parry)		^A
  Catches any attack. A whiff costs 80 meter and leaves her
  open.
Grab		^B
Back Grab (combo after)		_B^B
Burst (while being hit)		^X_+^Y_+^Z
  Invincible, no damage, hard knockdown. 75 second cooldown.
  Refills faster once a combo on her passes 15% of her life.
Power Charge (hold)		^Y_+^Z
Roll		^X_+^A
Back Roll		_B^X_+^A
Dash		_F_F
Back Step		_B_B
High Jump		_D_U

