Low Kick		_F^X
Sweep		_D^Z
Launcher (once per combo)		_DF^Z
Air Light / Medium / Heavy		^X / ^Y / ^Z
Charged Air Heavy (hold, air)		^Z
  Auto-releases when full: ground bounce. Once per combo.
Dash Drop Kick (during dash)		^Y
Dash Sliding Kick (during dash)		^Z

